# RTCP homing test — individual B/C axis homing
# Tests G28 B and G28 C separately to verify axis-to-stepper mapping
# Regression test for axis index mapping bug (E at commanded_pos[3])

DICTIONARY linuxprocess.dict
CONFIG rtcp.cfg

# Home all axes (establishes valid pivot positions)
G28 X Y Z B C

# Reset display to tip coordinates
G92 X0 Y0 Z0 B0 C0

# Move to safe working position
G1 X100 Z80 F6000

# Reset tip coordinates for verification
G92 X100 Y0 Z80 B0 C0

# --- Test: re-home B individually (verifies stepper mapping) ---
G28 B
M114

# --- Test: re-home C individually (verifies stepper mapping) ---
G28 C
M114

# --- Test: B+C move after re-homing ---
G1 B90 C180 F600
M114

# --- Test: return to zero ---
G1 B0 C0 F600
M114

GET_POSITION
